================================================================================
Runtime dependencies (NOT distributed by this project)
================================================================================
The following are required at runtime but must be obtained separately by the
user; nothing from them is redistributed in this repository:

- Microsoft PIX for Windows (pixtool.exe) - https://devblogs.microsoft.com/pix/
- Microsoft DirectX Shader Compiler (dxcompiler.dll / dxil.dll, ships with PIX)
- Microsoft D3D12 Agility SDK (downloaded from nuget.org by the exported
  project's CMake at configure time)
